Package: postvocs
Title: Post-Processing Tools for GC-MS Volatile Organic Compound Data
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Xiaotao", "Han", email = "postvocs.r@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides functions for processing Shimadzu GC-MS exported text files,
    extracting CAS numbers and peak areas, building abundance matrices, annotating
    compounds, and screening based on occurrence frequency.
Depends: R (>= 4.5.0)
Imports:
    dplyr,
    tidyr,
    openxlsx,
    readxl,
    rlang,
    webchem,
    tools
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://github.com/HanXT97/postvocs
BugReports: https://github.com/HanXT97/postvocs/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
